==English==
[[Image:Boat_Race_2015_-_Women%27s_Main_Race_(36).jpg|thumb|'''Backsplash''' seen off the oars as the rowers reach the catch.]]

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|back|splash}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-us-backsplash.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|æʃ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[vertical]] covering on a [[wall]] rising above a [[countertop]] or other work surface to [[protect]] the wall from [[spill]]s and to [[decorate]] the wall.
# {{lb|en|rowing}} The small [[splash]] of [[water]] that occurs when an [[oar]] enters the [[water]] to begin a [[stroke]], just before the [[rower]] reaches the [[catch]].

